        {
          "id": "288369d",
          "elType": "widget",
          "widgetType": "text-editor",
          "settings": {
            "editor": "<p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Plastic-Craft delivers plastics designed for the harsh environments of mining and mineral processing. Our materials are trusted because they provide extreme abrasion resistance, impact strength, and noise reduction &mdash; extending equipment life and improving worker safety.</p><p style=\"font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.85; color: #4A5568; text-align: center;\">Mining operators rely on our polymers for conveyor systems, chute liners, truck beds, and chemical delivery systems. Unlike steel, our plastics minimize noise, reduce friction, and are available in static-dissipative or flame-retardant versions for added safety. From coal and ore to precious metal recovery, Plastic-Craft supplies plastics that improve uptime, reduce costs, and handle the toughest applications with consistent performance.</p>",
            "align": "center"
          },
          "elements": []
        }
      ],
      "isInner": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1e1c0b1",
      "elType": "container",
      "settings": {
